## 8. Multi-Step Operations

When one instruction isn't enough:

```typescript
// Simple: array of instructions (sent as one transaction if fits, or split automatically)
await kit.execute([
  counter.instructions.initialize({ counter: addr1, authority: payer, initialValue: 0n }),
  counter.instructions.initialize({ counter: addr2, authority: payer, initialValue: 0n }),
